    "description": "Title:\nGlass Insulators Clear Set Of 2 Collectibles Bottles Electrical Power Line\nOptional Title:\nPair of Vintage Clear Glass Electrical Insulators\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nCountry Of Origin:\nUnited States\nDescription:\nEnhance your historical collection with this pair of vintage clear glass insulators, classic relics from the era of telegraph and telephone lines. Each insulator displays iconic, rounded contours and subtle amber tinting, showcasing glass craftsmanship from the early-to-mid 20th century. Perfect for collectors or as unique decor, the insulators' robust construction and preserved clarity highlight both their utility and nostalgic charm. Place them on a shelf, use them as paperweights, or incorporate them into upcycled art projects for an industrial twist. These pieces come gently used, with no major chips or cracks visible, and offer a glimpse into utility history with their original patina. Shop confidently knowing these genuine insulators are excellent examples for display, conversation, and educational purposes. Add a distinctive touch to your home or office with this timeless pair a piece of everyday heritage you can hold in your hands.",
